    <div class="subhead">A floristic database of local flora studied in Iran and neighbouring countries in the Middle East</div>

    <p><strong>Alamut</strong> is a comprehensive floristic database management system designed for floristic research, climatic data analysis, and taxonomic organization.
        Named after the historic mountain fortress, this application provides a robust platform for managing complex botanical datasets 
        with an emphasis on scientific accuracy and data relationships.</p>

